Figure 6.7: Upper: the centrality dependence of \(H_{\rm opp}-H_{\rm same}\) (where \(H_{\alpha\beta}=\gamma_{\alpha\beta}^{\rm CME}-\gamma_{\alpha\beta}^{\rm non- CME}\)) for Ru+Ru and Zr+Zr collisions at \(\sqrt{s_{NN}}=200\ {\rm GeV}\). Lower: the corresponding relative difference.

